":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T13:17:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T13:17:00Z","body":"Best do it in this one.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762098044/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762845391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120481#issuecomment-4762845391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120481","id":4762845391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-NAzw","user":{"login":"Shaderd00d","id":9315812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTU4MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9315812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d","html_url":"https://github.com/Shaderd00d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T18:07:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T18:08:27Z","body":"I removed \"inspector_path\" and deleted the dependencies as much as I could.\r\nHowever, the following is strange:\r\n```\r\nvoid EditorInspectorSection::_bind_methods() {\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"setup\", \"section\", \"label\", \"object\", \"bg_color\", \"foldable\", \"indent_depth\", \"level\"), &EditorInspectorSection::setup, DEFVAL(0), DEFVAL(1));\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"get_vbox\"), &EditorInspectorSection::get_vbox);\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"unfold\"), &EditorInspectorSection::unfold);\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"fold\"), &EditorInspectorSection::fold);\r\n```\r\n\r\ninspector_path wasn't included in the first ClassDB::bind_method \"setup\" and therefore could not have worked. I'm not sure if these four ClassDB::bind_method() calls are even used at all. Verifying this is beyond my capabilities and, I think, beyond the scope of this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762845391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762867536","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120481#issuecomment-4762867536","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120481","id":4762867536,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-OXUA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T18:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T18:16:28Z","body":"The argument list in `bind_method()` is for names only. If less arguments are registered, the remainder will show up in the documentation with generic names. The method can still be called normally.\r\n\r\nHowever EditorInspectorSection is not even a registered class, so all the bound methods are useless. They are leftovers from a long time ago and can be removed (not in this PR).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762867536/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771088828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120481#issuecomment-4771088828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120481","id":4771088828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHGEJvA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"ht